    "economy": "OSRS Wiki, Managing Miscellania, and its calculator Module:Miscellania_calculator (21 Sep 2026): each day the coffers pay min(5 + floor(coffer/10), 50,000 or 75,000 after Royal Trouble, coffer); worker effectiveness = floor(paid * 100 / 8333); resource points += floor(effectiveness * favour / 100), capped at 262,143; favour (0-127) then falls by ceil((160 or 131 - favour) / 15) while above 32.",
